; The VU1 microprogram and the DMA chain GfxDevice::Init() sends it through VIF1, from the
; .vutext section at 0x00664ab0. Each MPG block loads at the VU address it names. The entry
; points are Vu1Init (MSCAL from GfxDevice::Init()), Vu1DrawTexturedFaces and
; Vu1DrawUntexturedFaces (Rnd::PsMesh faces), Vu1DrawEdges (Rnd::PsMesh edges), and
; Vu1DrawSprites (Rnd::PsParticleSys). Branches from the entry points reach the other blocks.
; The chain ends by resetting the double-buffer base, offset, and cycle.

